      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "body",
      "label": "Body text",
      "default": "<p>We believe fragrance should not simply smell pleasant — it should tell a story, evoke a memory, transport you to a specific moment in time and space. Each bottle is a carefully composed narrative.</p><p>Our atelier works with rare, ethically sourced ingredients from around the world. From Himalayan cedarwood to Bulgarian rose absolute, we source only the finest materials and craft each fragrance in micro-batches to ensure exceptional quality and uniqueness.</p>"
